demo_type: MULTICOL
title: "Column Rule"
target_base_style: "column-count: 3; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #c0c8d4;"
target_inner_html: "Column rules create visual separators between columns. The column-rule shorthand sets the width, style, and color in a single declaration. Rules sit in the column gap and do not affect content width or layout flow."
